{"id":"00501","root":"uni00501_1","name":{"ja":"アンジェ","en":"Ange"},"title":{"ja":"【テンタクルディアンドル】","en":"【Tentacle Dirnd】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【テンタクルディアンドル】 アンジェ","en":"【Tentacle Dirnd】 Ange"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2021-08-31","limited":true,"characterId":29,"profile":{"ja":"米連の改造人間。魔族や対魔忍の力を移植されている。米連の施設で兵士として育てられ、戦闘経験も多い。集団戦が得意で、背中から無数の触手を出して多数の敵を葬り去る。大人ばかりの環境で育ったせいか、自分の感情を押し殺しがちで、自分の気持ちを素直に口に出すのは苦手である。組織外の人間との付き合いが増えていく中で、戦闘能力だけではなく円滑にコミュニケーションを取る能力も兵士として必要だと判断したアンジェは、米連基地で隊員慰労の為にオクトーバーフェストを模して開催された宴会の給仕に立候補する。制服として与えられたディアンドル風衣装の着心地は悪くない。まだまだ接客は覚束ないし、飲酒の醍醐味も理解出来ないが、楽しそうな客の様子を眺めていると、なんだか胸の辺りが暖かくなるのを感じるアンジェだった。","en":"Ange is a U.S.-engineered augment implanted with demon and Taimanin powers. She was raised as a soldier in U.S. facilities and has extensive combat experience. She excels in large-scale battles, burying foes by unfolding countless tentacles from her back. Having grown up surrounded only by adults, she tends to suppress her emotions and finds it hard to speak her feelings openly. As she interacts more with people outside the organization, she decided that, beyond combat skill, smooth communication is also necessary as a soldier, so she volunteered to serve as a waitress at a banquet modeled after Oktoberfest for troop morale at the U.S. base. The Diorndol-style uniform provided isn't uncomfortable. Though she's still inexperienced at hospitality and doesn't yet grasp the joy of drinking, watching the lively guests makes her chest feel warm."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00501_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1108,2216],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[146,292],"def":[116,232],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","1180001"]},{"id":"uni00501_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1716,3432],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[227,454],"def":[167,334],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","